            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Perch 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Hiding and showing icons works again on macOS 27.</li>
<li>New app icon.</li>
<li>Right-click the menu bar icon for settings, updates, feedback and Quit. Option-click shows or hides hidden icons.</li>
<li>The panel no longer flickers while it refreshes.</li>
<li>Report a Problem, Suggest a Feature and Send Feedback from inside the app.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
